Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 14:19:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Title: Redesign network map with schematic layout and fix
 offline-only filter

Key features implemented:
- Redesigned NetworkMap component with horizontal schematic layout replacing circular topology
- Added showOfflineOnly state and functionality to filter agents by online status
- Implemented toggle button for "Only offline" mode with visual indicator
- Enhanced agent node visualization using rectangular shapes with gradient borders
- Updated statistics cards and legend to reflect new layout and filtering options
- Improved modal dialogs with detailed information for agents, IPs, and direct devices
- Added conditional rendering for empty states when no offline agents exist
- Optimized agent positioning algorithm using vertical column layout instead of radial

The network visualization now uses a clear horizontal flow from PLUTO core to agents to IP ranges, making the topology easier to understand while adding functional filtering capabilities.
